	"Description": "Hey, I decided to repurpose a few graphics for my upcoming mod to suit additionial purposes in the meantime.\n<br />I've utilized basegame sprites and edited them to my liking, while still remaining in the same style as the original game.\n<br />\n<br />I suggest using them in combination with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1099]Customize Exterior[/url] so that you can use other mods as well.\n<br />Should you choose to replace existing files, I highly suggest using [url=https://community.playstarbound.com/threads/smapi-xnb-loader.130047/]XNB Loader[/url] instead to prevent updates from wiping your files.\n<br />\n<br />All building mods will be available on this page for a more organized view.\n<br />\n<br />Currently includes:\n<br />\n<br />Junimo Housing - [Junimo Hut]\n<br />Small House - [Shed]\n<br />Brick Coops - [Small Coop, Big Coop &amp; Deluxe Coop]\n<br />Dilapidated House &amp; Storage - [House &amp; Greenhouse]\n<br />Dilapidated Barn - [Small Barn, Big Barn &amp; Deluxe Barn]",
